b_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "Hi everyone, \r\n\r\nI am currently trying to install mavsdk on Jetson Nano, i had some problems so this is how I fixed them.\r\n\r\nThe system is:\r\n\r\n- Jetpack 4.6\r\n- Ubuntu 18.04 LTS\r\n- Python 3.6.9\r\n\r\n**Because of other libraries (vpi, jetson-utils etc.) it is not possible to update python, so i am stuck with v3.6.9.** \r\n\r\nMy first error was with pip, it didn't install the mavsdk because of a dependency\r\n\r\n![Ads\u0131z](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/42386450/195956633-32ea90ff-c4b8-4c0a-8100-fa5ad79ad10e.png)\r\n\r\nI kinda got around this problem with `pip3 install protobuf==3.19.6 mavsdk` this command, and now it can import mavsdk in python\r\n\r\nNow the problem is the mavsdk-server, \r\n\r\nI connected the Pixhawk Cube - Jetson Nano via UART, and connections are ok but there is no mavsdk-server on the Jetson.\r\n\r\nWhen I run the python examples:\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/42386450/195957115-a42fba75-d9d9-4190-ac9c-a6821d10646b.png)\r\n\r\nHow can i install mavsdk-server on Jetson Nano ? Is it possible to just build it without mavsdk itself, (I am not familiar with ubuntu os)\r\n\r\nAny help would be appreciated.", "closed_by": {"login": "YasinBedirhanSimsek", "id": 42386450, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjQyMzg2NDUw", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42386450?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/YasinBedirhanSimsek", "html_url": "https://github.com/YasinBedirhanSimsek", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YasinBedirhanSimsek/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YasinBedirhanSimsek/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YasinBedirhanSimsek/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YasinBedirhanSimsek/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YasinBedirhanSimsek/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YasinBedirhanSimsek/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YasinBedirhanSimsek/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YasinBedirhanSimsek/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/YasinBedirhanSimsek/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1916/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1916/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": "completed", "pinned_comment": null}, "comments": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1279595153", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1916#issuecomment-1279595153", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1916", "id": 1279595153, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s5MRRKR", "user": {"login": "JonasVautherin", "id": 2606672, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI2MDY2NzI=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2606672?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin", "html_url": "https://github.com/JonasVautherin", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautheri